    {
      "text": "This kindhearted Pokémon nurses sick Pokémon to health. It senses feelings of sadness.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is a Pokémon that delivers happiness. Eating its egg is said to make one kind to everyone.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "The eggs it lays are filled with happiness. Eating even one bite will bring a smile to anyone.",
