    {
      "text": "Blissey senses sadness with its fluffy coat of fur. If it does so, this Pokémon will rush over to a sad person, no matter how far away, to share a Lucky Egg that brings a smile to any face.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Blissey senses sadness with its fluffy coat of fur. If it does so, this Pokémon will rush over to a sad person, no matter how far away, to share a Lucky Egg that brings a smile to any face.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Even the most ferocious Pokémon become calm when they eat Blissey’s egg, which is said to be filled with happiness.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its fluffy fur coat acts as a sensor, enabling it to read the feelings of people and Pokémon.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Their eggs are such a delicacy that some say eating one will bring you happiness. These eggs fetch the highest prices on the market.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "This Pokémon is overflowing with love. Only Chansey that share a strong bond with their Trainer can evolve, so people say.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whenever a Blissey finds a weakened Pokémon, it will share its egg and offer its care until the other Pokémon is all better.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "Blissey lays mysterious eggs that are filled with happiness. It’s said that anyone who eats a Blissey egg will start acting kindly to all others.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "A kindhearted Pokémon that will care for any sick person or Pokémon until their health improves. The eggs it lays are delicious and bring good fortune to those who eat them.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
